   "text": "There are costs with war, $c... ones often overlooked.  Those costs are the orphans - children who have lost their parents to the far-too-numerous conflicts that rage across Azeroth.  Those children who have no one else to turn to often come here to live until they are old enough to fend for themselves.\n\nOne week out of the year during the Spring, the Alliance takes time to give something back to these innocents.  This time is called Children's Week.\r\n",
